<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on seven German firms.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on seven German firms.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York said it has issued 100 million American-style call and put warrants, in 20 equal tranches. There are two tranches on Dresdner Bank AG, four tranches on Hoechst AG, four tranches on BASF AG, four tranches on Bayer AG, four tranches on Bayerische Vereinsbank AG, two tranches on Commerzbank AG and one tranche on Deutsche Bank AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   16.SEP.96	     LISTING  DUSS, FRFT</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100		     QUOTED IN MARKS</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
